{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49333","headline":"怨王孙 · 韦庄","name":"怨王孙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦里，蚕市。\n满街珠翠，千万红妆。\n玉蝉金雀，宝髻花簇鸣璫，绣衣长。\n日斜归去人难见，青楼远，队队行云散。\n不知今夜，何处深锁兰房，隔仙乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}